# The workspace (crates/app/src/workspace): documents and tabs, the
# dialogs' shared enums, filters and adjustments, export, colour
# management, the in-app file picker, crash recovery, and the status-bar
# messages each of them sets. Keyed by module: workspace.<module>.<what>.
# The dialogs' own labels are in dialogs.lang; the canvas-side modules
# (edit_ops, image_ops, layers panel, …) are in workspace-canvas.lang.

